>>>>
>>>> job_started just reads job->co. If bs runs in iothread, and therefor=
e write-notifier
>>>> is in iothread, when job_start is called from main thread.. Is it gu=
aranteed that
>>>> write-notifier will see job->co variable change early enough to not =
